      "text": "📣Introducing the Inadmissible Alien Apprehension Fee- a fee assessed for each apprehension of an amenable alien. Amenable aliens are: \n\n ▪️Any alien 14 years of age or older who illegally entered the United States without being inspected or admitted and is determined to be inadmissible. \n\n ▪️This fee can be issued to all aliens who illegally entered regardless of processing disposition, location of illegal entry, length of time present in the United States, or current immigration proceedings. \n\nONE BIG BEAUTIFUL BILL in effect.",
